# Test-only ESP-IDF main task budget. Source-level EDLS inspection uses
# bounded nested C++20 local state; default 3584B main stack was measured
# INSUFFICIENT on native WROOM, real HIL run 20261026T100632-e35fbdca.
# The application/Bootstrap must budget each actual worker stack separately.
CONFIG_ESP_MAIN_TASK_STACK_SIZE=8192
